{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"issues\":[{\"sec\":\"S06\",\"screen\":\"离开后常得【独自熬难事】。\",\"source\":\"想到以后遇上难处可能仍得独自承担；离开那些人后，他才明白有人陪在身边曾让自己轻松许多。\",\"type\":\"3\",\"severity\":\"严重\",\"why\":\"把对未来可能独自承担难处的担心，写成离开后已经经常发生的处境。\"},{\"sec\":\"S07\",\"screen\":\"想到【以后难事还得独自扛】\",\"source\":\"想到以后遇上难处可能仍得独自承担\",\"type\":\"2\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"把“可能仍得”改成“还得”，将尚不确定的担忧写成了确定判断。\"},{\"sec\":\"S09\",\"screen\":\"想回去，是【舍不得亲近】\",\"source\":\"他分不清想回去是舍不得被接纳，还是怕孤单到愿再忍那些委屈。\",\"type\":\"8\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"把具体的“舍不得被接纳”概括成“舍不得亲近”，改变并模糊了他真正舍不得的东西。\"},{\"sec\":\"S10\",\"screen\":\"他【最放不下那份亲近】\",\"source\":\"他渐渐认清，最放不下的是曾被当作自己人的日子，回去却未必重获。\",\"type\":\"8\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"把曾被当作自己人的具体经历概括成一般的亲近，弱化了其中被接纳和归属的含义。\"}]}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "fb684af6-0c36-451c-b12f-21f6891e9616", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T022639800451Z", "elapsed_seconds": 107.032, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T02:28:26.850095+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "de3ae2bbbd75175291c4dc7f6caa87bdc009e6d471f938b3ad401ad1e76abd9d", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_n